Update MoltenVK to a development build that allows 16 descriptor sets

KSA's shaders use descriptor sets 0-9. The MoltenVK in Sikarugir wrappers
(1.4.2) allows 8, so some shaders fail to compile ("cannot reserve 'buffer'
resource location") and the game crashes. SPIRV-Cross raised the limit to 16
in commit 76301541, but no MoltenVK release uses it yet. So this is a
development build of MoltenVK and SPIRV-Cross, with all their latest changes.

Remove once the wrapper ships a MoltenVK with the higher limit.
---
target wrapper:Frameworks/libMoltenVK.dylib
$ git clone https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK.git && cd MoltenVK
$ git checkout 50b3cbf373f4165947e0e315c0c37cfb658dfd51
$ echo aa217aeb6c9f0ace7a0ab233b28807edf45eb165 > ExternalRevisions/SPIRV-Cross_repo_revision
$ ./fetchDependencies --macos
$ make macos
$ cp Package/Release/MoltenVK/dynamic/dylib/macOS/libMoltenVK.dylib "$OUT"
$ cp LICENSE "$LICENSES/MoltenVK.txt"
$ cp External/SPIRV-Cross/LICENSE "$LICENSES/SPIRV-Cross.txt"
$ cp External/cereal/LICENSE "$LICENSES/cereal.txt"
$ cp External/Vulkan-Headers/LICENSE.md "$LICENSES/Vulkan-Headers.md"
